  "接入、凭证、调试和用量都在同一个项目工作台完成。": "Setup, credentials, debugging and usage share one project workspace.",
  "打开项目凭证": "Open project credentials",
  "打开请求调试": "Open request debugger",
  "查看已启用模型": "View enabled models",
  "常见错误与排查": "Common errors & troubleshooting",
  "网关错误响应中的 doc_url 会打开这里；默认只列常见调用错误，可按错误码、HTTP 状态或说明搜索。": "Gateway doc_url links open this reference. Common errors are shown by default; search by code, HTTP status or description.",
  "搜索错误码": "Search error codes",
  "搜索错误码、HTTP 状态或处理建议": "Search error code, HTTP status or action",
  "没有匹配的错误说明": "No matching error reference",
  "请核对完整错误码后重试。": "Check the full error code and try again.",
  "按当前项目管理员权限展示项目、访问、通知和模型调用合同；部署、供应商与财务接口不会在此展示。": "Shows project, access, notification and model API contracts available to the current project administrator. Deployment, provider and finance APIs are outside this scope.",
  "供管理人员查看其权限范围内的 API、客户端兼容性、证据等级与配置边界；协议兼容不等于已完成真实客户端认证。": "APIs, client compatibility, evidence levels and configuration boundaries within your permissions. Protocol compatibility alone does not establish verified client support.",
  "Agent 客户端兼容矩阵": "Agent client compatibility",
  "等级从代码合同返回；只有通过独立客户端或端到端证据的能力才标记 verified。": "Levels come from the code contract. Only capabilities with independent client or end-to-end evidence are marked verified.",
  "存在已登记、已启用且独立观测为 ready 的附加 Gateway Endpoint；真实客户端认证与模型调用仍需单独验证。": "An additional Gateway Endpoint is registered, enabled and independently observed as ready. Actual client authentication and model calls still require separate verification.",
  "尚未登记并独立验证附加 Gateway Endpoint；这不等同于当前 UniRouter 服务不可用。当前服务健康看“运行状态”，现场可用性以真实 API 调用为准。": "No additional Gateway Endpoint has been registered and independently verified. This does not indicate that the current UniRouter service is unavailable. See Runtime status for service health and use actual API calls to verify availability.",
  "OpenAI Agents SDK 的默认 Responses 路径仍为 contract_only / unsupported；第二次联调必须显式使用 Chat Completions 适配路径。": "The OpenAI Agents SDK default Responses path remains contract_only / unsupported. The second integration run must explicitly use the Chat Completions adapter.",
  "请求身份与幂等": "Request identity & idempotency",
  "这些字段用途不同，不能互相替代。": "These fields serve different purposes and are not interchangeable.",
  "：UniRouter 每次请求强制生成的操作 ID，用于串联网关、计费、审计和故障切换。": ": an operation ID generated by UniRouter for every request, linking gateway execution, billing, audit and failover.",
  "：调用方自己的关联值，只用于查找，不作为全局财务主键。": ": the caller’s correlation value, used for lookup only, never as the global financial primary key.",
  "：本次网关准入实际使用的共享限额策略集合指纹，可与请求日志中的策略链一起排障。": ": a fingerprint of the shared limit policy set used for admission. Use it with the request log policy chain to investigate issues.",
  "：Chat / Embeddings 使用 24 小时元数据去重；图像任务使用项目、API Key 与请求内容绑定的持久身份。两者都不会在准入响应中重放模型输出。": ": Chat / Embeddings use 24-hour metadata deduplication. Image jobs use a durable identity bound to the project, API Key and request body. Neither replays model output in the admission response.",
  "Agent 能力边界": "Agent permission boundaries",
  "UniRouter 只授予模型网关调用权，不授予 Tool、IAM、数据库或导出权限。": "UniRouter grants model gateway access only. It does not grant Tool, IAM, database or export permissions.",
  "Supervisor 使用根 API Key 显式登记工作流；每个子 Agent 必须由父 Agent 调用委派接口登记，系统不会从普通流量中猜测子 Agent。": "A Supervisor explicitly registers a workflow using a root API Key. Every child Agent must be registered by its parent through the delegation API; ordinary traffic never implies a child Agent.",
  "能力令牌最长": "Capability tokens last up to",
  "5 分钟": "5 minutes",
  "，通常在第 3 分钟附近带抖动刷新；工作流时长、深度、扇出和预算独立计算。": ", with jittered refresh usually around minute 3. Workflow duration, depth, fan-out and budget are tracked independently.",
  "委派合同中的模型、接口、成本、Token、RPM、RPS 与并发上限只能保持或缩小；共享预算的运行时扣减由后续分布式策略批次接入。根权限变化最多 15 秒被所有实例重新核对；Redis 状态不可用时能力请求拒绝准入。": "Delegated model, API, cost, Token, RPM, RPS and concurrency limits can only stay the same or narrow. Shared budget consumption will be connected in a later distributed policy batch. Every instance rechecks root permission changes within 15 seconds; capability requests fail closed when Redis state is unavailable.",
  "个接口": "endpoints",
  "模型网关使用项目 API Key 或 Agent 能力令牌鉴权；控制台登录态不适用于这些协议接口。": "Model gateway APIs require a project API Key or Agent capability token. A console session cannot authenticate these protocol endpoints.",
